WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:17.092
For over a day, the wind from the fan carried Wukong.

2
00:00:19.193 --> 00:00:23.354
When he finally landed, he was far from the Iron Immortal’s mountain.

3
00:00:25.435 --> 00:00:28.295
Wukong looked around and saw a mountain nearby.

4
00:00:29.156 --> 00:00:30.016
It looked familiar.

5
00:00:31.124 --> 00:00:32.085
“Mount Sumeru!”

6
00:00:32.345 --> 00:00:33.105
said Wukong.

7
00:00:34.045 --> 00:00:35.726
“The bodhisattva Lingji lives there.

8
00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:38.907
Maybe he can help me deal with the Iron Immortal.

9
00:00:39.548 --> 00:00:42.789
He was able to stop the great king Yellow Wind’s wind magic.”

10
00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:47.551
The monkey went to Lingji’s pagoda.

11
00:00:50.152 --> 00:00:52.353
The bodhisattva was sitting in his garden.

12
00:00:52.373 --> 00:00:55.694
“Greetings, Bodhisattva,” said Wukong.

13
00:00:55.714 --> 00:00:59.256
“Hello, Wukong,” said Lingji.

14
00:01:00.104 --> 00:01:01.265
“It’s good to see you again.

15
00:01:02.225 --> 00:01:03.806
I was just about to have tea.”

16
00:01:06.047 --> 00:01:09.008
Wukong and Lingji sat outside, drinking tea.

17
00:01:10.168 --> 00:01:14.190
The monkey told the bodhisattva everything that had happened with the Iron Immortal.

18
00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:18.632
The bodhisattva handed a small stone to Wukong.

19
00:01:18.652 --> 00:01:22.133
“Keep this magic stone in your pocket.

20
00:01:22.953 --> 00:01:25.374
It will stop the wind from blowing you away.”

21
00:01:25.394 --> 00:01:28.756
“Thank you, Bodhisattva,” said the monkey.

22
00:01:29.964 --> 00:01:31.666
“Would you like to stay for lunch?”

23
00:01:32.286 --> 00:01:33.147
asked Lingji.

24
00:01:33.167 --> 00:01:35.769
“No, thank you,” said Wukong.

25
00:01:35.789 --> 00:01:38.471
“I must get back to my companions.

26
00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:42.755
I need to get that fan from the Iron Immortal so we can continue west.”

27
00:01:44.256 --> 00:01:47.178
Wukong returned to the Iron Immortal’s cave door.

28
00:01:47.198 --> 00:01:50.301
“Open up!”

29
00:01:50.541 --> 00:01:51.162
he shouted.

30
00:01:51.182 --> 00:01:53.183
“I need your fan!”

31
00:01:57.147 --> 00:02:00.089
The Iron Immortal came out and wrinkled her nose.

32
00:02:00.109 --> 00:02:02.530
“I thought I got rid of you.”

33
00:02:03.371 --> 00:02:04.612
She raised her fan.

34
00:02:04.632 --> 00:02:08.114
“I’ll just have to wave harder this time!”

35
00:02:09.275 --> 00:02:11.396
The woman waved the fan furiously.

36
00:02:13.257 --> 00:02:15.379
A terrible wind blew past Wukong.

37
00:02:16.719 --> 00:02:18.140
But the monkey didn’t move.

38
00:02:20.462 --> 00:02:22.963
The Iron Immortal’s eyes burned with anger.

39
00:02:22.983 --> 00:02:29.426
“How did you—” “The bodhisattva Lingji gave me a magic stone,” said Wukong.

40
00:02:29.446 --> 00:02:32.327
“Your fan can’t blow me away now.”

41
00:02:33.848 --> 00:02:36.008
The monkey pulled out his iron bar.

42
00:02:36.028 --> 00:02:37.949
“Now give me that fan!”

43
00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:41.051
The Iron Immortal shot back into her cave.

44
00:02:41.911 --> 00:02:45.393
Before she could shut the door, Wukong turned into a cricket.

45
00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:48.794
He quickly leaped into the cave.

46
00:02:49.754 --> 00:02:53.136
Silently he followed the Iron Immortal along a tunnel.

47
00:02:57.996 --> 00:03:00.537
When the woman reached a room, she sat down.

48
00:03:01.598 --> 00:03:03.579
She tucked the fan into her robe.

49
00:03:03.599 --> 00:03:06.821
“Wukong is a horrible monkey!”

50
00:03:07.081 --> 00:03:08.061
she said to herself.

51
00:03:08.081 --> 00:03:12.104
“He forced my poor baby, Red Boy, to become good.

52
00:03:13.204 --> 00:03:15.986
Then he demanded to borrow my precious fan!”

53
00:03:16.806 --> 00:03:19.147
The Iron Immortal reached for a cup of water.

54
00:03:20.068 --> 00:03:23.229
As she took a drink, Wukong leaped into the cup.

55
00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:30.646
Gulp! Inside the Iron Immortal’s stomach, Wukong changed back into himself.

56
00:03:32.607 --> 00:03:33.948
Boomph! Pow!

57
00:03:34.088 --> 00:03:35.249
Boomph! Pow!

58
00:03:35.949 --> 00:03:37.471
The monkey punched and kicked.

59
00:03:38.952 --> 00:03:41.233
The Iron Immortal fell to her knees.

60
00:03:41.253 --> 00:03:44.515
“Ahh! What was in that water?

61
00:03:45.656 --> 00:03:46.957
I feel awful!”

62
00:03:46.977 --> 00:03:48.938
“It was me!”

63
00:03:49.219 --> 00:03:50.139
shouted Wukong.

64
00:03:50.159 --> 00:03:52.301
“I’m in your stomach now!

65
00:03:53.101 --> 00:03:56.644
And I won’t stop punching and kicking until you give me that fan!”

66
00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:58.721
Boomph! Pow!

67
00:03:58.741 --> 00:04:00.601
“Please stop!”

68
00:04:00.962 --> 00:04:02.222
cried the Iron Immortal.

69
00:04:02.242 --> 00:04:04.223
“You can have the fan.

70
00:04:05.063 --> 00:04:06.564
Just don’t hurt me anymore!”

71
00:04:06.584 --> 00:04:11.926
Wukong leaped out through the woman’s nose and returned to his normal size.

72
00:04:11.946 --> 00:04:14.747
“Give me the fan!”

73
00:04:14.987 --> 00:04:15.648
he demanded.

74
00:04:16.668 --> 00:04:19.009
The Iron Immortal climbed back to her feet.

75
00:04:19.789 --> 00:04:22.270
She reached into her robe and pulled out a fan.

76
00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.231
“Here, take it.

77
00:04:24.912 --> 00:04:25.572
Now leave!”

78
00:04:28.076 --> 00:04:30.958
Wukong found his companions in the village with the old man.

79
00:04:31.898 --> 00:04:35.040
The monkey explained how he’d tricked the Iron Immortal.

80
00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:38.582
“Wonderful!” said the Tang Monk.

81
00:04:38.602 --> 00:04:40.883
“Now we can continue our journey.”

82
00:04:42.805 --> 00:04:45.546
They all thanked the old man and then headed west.

83
00:04:48.368 --> 00:04:51.850
They came to the top of a hill and saw the Mountain of Flames.

84
00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:55.412
Fire covered all the land around it.

85
00:04:56.476 --> 00:04:58.217
“Watch this,” said Wukong.

86
00:04:59.137 --> 00:05:01.098
The monkey waved the fan hard.

87
00:05:01.838 --> 00:05:06.200
Whoosh! A strong wind blew toward the mountain.

88
00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.261
Wukong smiled.

89
00:05:08.281 --> 00:05:16.124
“In a moment, we’ll—” Suddenly there was a roar as the flames grew bigger, filling the sky!
